                        Shows a Client.txt monitor on most pages. This is required for each of the following settings.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <label class="setting-switch">
                    <input id="EnableLogReader"
                           type="checkbox"
                           checked="@StoredSettings.EnableLogReader"
